    "text": "LIVE\nUpdated 1 hour ago\nStocks to Watch: SpaceX, Qualcomm, Robinhood\n↗️ SpaceX (SPCX): Shares of Elon Musk’s rocket company are poised for another day of gains, following a two-day rally that pushed the stock up about 43% from its IPO price. Shares rose 8% in early trading.\n↗️Robinhood Markets (HOOD): Shares in the brokerage ticked higher after it said it would lay off about 10% of its workforce to cut costs and improve efficiency. The move will impact about 290 jobs.\n↗️ Go Inc. (JP:581A): Shares of the ride-hailing app jumped 10% in their Tokyo trading debut after Japan’s largest initial public offering of the year so far.",
